{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.610000610351562,"text":"Small bottles and cups of glass, thin as a shell, which over time have taken on iridescent colors like a soap bubble. That color was not there originally. The soil made it, wearing the surface into very thin layers that split the light. The Romans learned to blow glass and made it cheap, so within a few generations it stopped being a luxury and became the ordinary cup in a house.","words":[{"word":"Small","start":0,"end":0.800000011920929},{"word":"bottles","start":0.800000011920929,"end":1.1799999475479126},{"word":"and","start":1.1799999475479126,"end":1.7599999904632568},{"word":"cups","start":1.7599999904632568,"end":1.7599999904632568},{"word":"of","start":1.7599999904632568,"end":2.4000000953674316},{"word":"glass","start":2.4000000953674316,"end":2.4000000953674316},{"word":"thin","start":2.9000000953674316,"end":2.9200000762939453},{"word":"as","start":2.9200000762939453,"end":3.0999999046325684},{"word":"a","start":3.0999999046325684,"end":3.4800000190734863},{"word":"shell","start":3.4800000190734863,"end":3.4800000190734863},{"word":"which","start":3.9600000381469727,"end":4.099999904632568},{"word":"over","start":4.099999904632568,"end":4.380000114440918},{"word":"time","start":4.380000114440918,"end":4.679999828338623},{"word":"have","start":4.679999828338623,"end":5},{"word":"taken","start":5,"end":5.239999771118164},{"word":"on","start":5.239999771118164,"end":5.840000152587891},{"word":"iridescent","start":5.840000152587891,"end":6.199999809265137},{"word":"colors","start":6.199999809265137,"end":6.579999923706055},{"word":"like","start":6.579999923706055,"end":6.860000133514404},{"word":"a","start":6.860000133514404,"end":7.179999828338623},{"word":"soap","start":7.179999828338623,"end":7.199999809265137},{"word":"bubble","start":7.199999809265137,"end":7.440000057220459},{"word":"That","start":8.140000343322754,"end":8.359999656677246},{"word":"color","start":8.35999965